(text ".options method=gear\n.tran 5n 41u" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9be870ae-0712-4948-89e2-878d930cd2e1"))
(text "DFFP2_J2N16 testbench (tools/kicad/gen_dffp_j2n16.py, stimulus, part values and .meas from tools/spice/pff_tb.py).\nSTIM_D (HV PWL, ideal) -> divider -> driver triode (Ra 10k): its plate is the HV net D1. CK: the HV clock line, 30 ns edges.\nThe two flip-flops form a shift register: Q1 drives D2 and a divider with 4 grids; QN1, Q2, QN2 a divider with 6 grids each.\nClock 2.0 us (rising edge captures); FF1.Q -> FF2.D; D1 changes 0.5 us after the edge.\nThe plain-SPICE run of the same bench: python3 tools/spice/pff_tb.py" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 320.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e7d3263f-7684-4954-9232-fde03f5db6b9"))
